WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.017 line:85%
A broken wheel helped me make my biggest discovery!

2
00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:06.962 line:85%
I'm Spirit, Opportunity's twin rover.

3
00:00:07.052 --> 00:00:11.958 line:85%
I landed in Gusev Crater on Mars in 2004.

4
00:00:12.048 --> 00:00:16.485 line:85%
Every day, I drove across the crater, studying rocks and soil.

5
00:00:16.575 --> 00:00:19.539 line:85%
Then one of my six wheels stopped turning.

6
00:00:19.629 --> 00:00:23.860 line:85%
So I dragged it through the soil, leaving a deep track.

7
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:29.501 line:85%
Because of that, I uncovered bright soil that was about 90% silica!

8
00:00:29.591 --> 00:00:34.442 line:85%
Scientists think it could have come from a hot spring or from steam.

9
00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:37.751 line:85%
Have you ever turned a problem into a discovery?
